Z||000010||rogergarrison||09-05-2001||11:11 PM||||yep, youll never get all the fuel out of a tank. To gain a 1/2 gallon wouldnt be worth the effort even if it did fit. A tip to save wear and tear on fuel pump, keep the tank over half full if you can. Turning, stopping and starting will slosh the gas away from pickup and make it run dry for a second or two. So dont drive around with less than a quarter tank, the pump will be running unnecessarily 2 times as much.||||reg||1
